<title>TAJIKISTAN: SOCCER-CHINA BEAT TAJIKISTAN IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA BEAT TAJIKISTAN IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat Tajikistan 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Hao Hiedoon (66)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
